      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1032722873,
          "type": null,
          "body": "We shouldn't merge this. The way the script works is to check if a packages is available and if not print the \"* is unavailable\" message. The mangend packages are only availabe in OpenSUSE and are not required by CentOS for example. Therefore this is not a \"hard\" fail.\nHowever we should enhance the echo message for these packages to make it clear that this is not an problem.",
